Package: adorn
Title: A Framework for Writing and Applying Function Decorators
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Dyfan", "Jones", , "dyfan.r.jones@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A framework for creating function decorators in R. Decorators
    can be applied to functions and to S3, S4, S7 and R6 methods.
